This is a new and *really* nasty feature in the 3.13 version.

First : Donate just enough money to get the desired effekt, i.e. 400 
zorkmids per level (own, not dungeon :)). If you donate unneccessary
high amounts, the priest is sulking...

Second : Before donating, SAVE and COPY. As almost all in NetHack, this
seems to be a probability thing. Once you've got 3 or 4 AC's by donating,
the prob' is dropping in free fall. This applies even, when you got your
first AC's from a lawful priest and then test it on an other aligment.

Third : Other neat things : Neither me, sorry
That will say, besides the occasional blessing, but I don't remember, if
the priest was co-aligned or not.
	
Fourth : Donate to a not-co-aligned priest. If your armor-class is high
enough and you can cure blindness (or don't care), you can get your money
back by *KILLING* him. By the way, this is a great method of getting books.
You can use the same money on the next priest.
*KILLING* priests is considered bad taste for Lawful charakters, I thinK...

Wounds appear all over your body... You die...


